# Docker build context for the runtime image.
#
# The image build only needs source (Go + the committed web/dist bundle). Keep
# the context small and deterministic: the dev-sandbox caches that live under the
# repo root are large and must not be shipped into the image.
#
# IMPORTANT: web/dist is NOT ignored — web/embed.go embeds it, so the Go build
# needs it present. Only node_modules (not needed once dist exists) is excluded.

# Version control / tooling
.git
.gitignore
.github
.opencode

# Dev-sandbox runtime state and caches (compose mounts these into /workspace)
.go/
.xdg-data/
.xdg-cache/
.xdg-state/
.node/
air.log
tmp/

# Node dependencies — the dashboard is built ahead of time into web/dist
web/node_modules/
web/**/*.tsbuildinfo

# Local build outputs and test artifacts
/api
/worker
*.test
*.out
coverage.*

# Docs and compose files are not needed inside the image
Dockerfile
docker-compose.yml
README.md
